            <span class="text-red-400 text-xs">&#10007;</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-foreground">Unverified benchmark claims</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-secondary mb-0">
            The 82.9% Terminal-Bench score has <strong>no independently verified entry</strong> as of launch. Meta's prior model (Muse Spark 1.1) inflated by 3.8 points vs verified scores. Vals AI ranks Muse Spark 1.2 at 14th of 50 in a common harness.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-yellow-500/20 bg-yellow-500/[0.03] p-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
            <span class="text-yellow-400 text-xs">&#9888;</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-foreground">Beta status</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-secondary mb-0">
            The crash-safe replay log has not been independently stress-tested. Meta's 24-hour, 1,000+ tool call demo is compelling but unverified. Trust, but verify on a low-stakes repo first.
          </p>
        </div>
